---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure | Vyxqor" description="Vyxqor's affiliate disclosure policy. We are transparent about commercial relationships and they never influence our editorial ratings.">
<div class="container" style="padding: 48px 0 80px; max-width: 720px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: August 13, 2026 | Complies with FTC 16 CFR Part 255</p>

  <div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
    <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text); font-weight: 500;">
      Vyxqor is an independent AI discovery platform. Some links on this site are affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you click through and make a purchase or subscription. This comes at no additional cost to you.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-2);">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">1. What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
      <p>Affiliate links are special URLs that contain a tracking code. When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, the merchant (e.g., Cursor, Notion, Perplexity) pays us a small commission as a referral fee. This is how many independent review sites fund their operations.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Our Editorial Independence</h2>
      <p><strong>Commercial relationships do not determine our editorial ratings, rankings, or recommendations.</strong></p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Our Vyxqor Score is calculated based on:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Independent hands-on testing</li>
        <li>Capability, ease of use, value, and reliability metrics</li>
        <li>Real user feedback and verified reviews</li>
        <li>Feature verification against official documentation</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">No tool can pay for a higher score or a better ranking. Period.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">3. How We Identify Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Every page containing affiliate links includes:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>A disclosure statement near the primary call-to-action</li>
        <li><code>rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"</code> tags on all affiliate links</li>
        <li>This dedicated disclosure page linked from every commercial page</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Current Affiliate Partners</h2>
      <p>As of August 2026, Vyxqor participates in affiliate programs with:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Cursor (via FirstPromoter)</li>
        <li>Notion (via Impact)</li>
        <li>Perplexity (via Impact)</li>
        <li>Anthropic / Claude (direct program)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">This list is updated as partnerships change.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">5. Sponsored Content</h2>
      <p>Occasionally, we may publish sponsored content or featured listings. These are always clearly labeled as:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li><strong>"Sponsored"</strong> — content paid for by a third party</li>
        <li><strong>"Featured"</strong> — paid placement in listings or rankings</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Sponsored content never influences editorial scores or independent reviews.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">6. Questions?</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about our affiliate relationships or editorial independence, contact: <a href="mailto:transparency@vyxqor.com" style="color: var(--accent);">transparency@vyxqor.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>